          "context_uid": "497036ef-19ef-5611-bf5a-a9eeaf1569a0",
          "memories": [
            {
              "content": "The user's available days and times vary by week, making it difficult to apply last month's free time directly to the next appointment.",
              "content_digest": "9883c185fcf05c7f7f2b427012701a926576130739a6a43f6cd4e94f26f7e87d",
              "position": 0,
              "uid": "84b4519d-ef17-5403-a866-4eb705951a09"
            },
            {
              "content": "The user once canceled an appointment booked for the same weekday as in the previous month.",
              "content_digest": "9d38149632b950760dbbfdf98630e74e48c0a2130b1293142adef0f9948485bb",
              "position": 1,
              "uid": "25994612-bebc-5643-8642-19b825f00f00"
            },
            {
              "content": "When asked again about availability just before booking, the user provided three free times for that week.",
              "content_digest": "6d7bf61d037b8f702b87eb75ca99670e46f8ed37eb3cd0588f232a63cbe7d97c",
              "position": 2,
              "uid": "9b667d0d-d97b-5dfa-af66-295b9c40403d"
            },
            {
              "content": "On a day with two consecutive morning appointments, the user ate lunch at 3 p.m.",
              "content_digest": "6cf4e59cc0449ecab23ac3e5b69e3993146fb9e31de4ddf7ddab1c81a47c2b8a",
              "position": 3,
              "uid": "54d29daf-7bd7-5221-ae65-8b46f7f4869b"
            },
            {
              "content": "On a day the user left an hour between appointments, they ate while traveling.",
              "content_digest": "f669cb3d5198e5eed84c2578c8810a8105d03b2d68064bd323dd6573339e2a3b",
              "position": 4,
              "uid": "375957b9-e051-5a94-bde1-d157f44cc343"
            },
            {
              "content": "After seeing a private reason written directly in a calendar title, the user removed the wording.",
              "content_digest": "6f32d03fd9854adaf5773fab91d96d94b8d50557dd7d3bf090caaf37488ad121",
              "position": 5,
              "uid": "d189ddb4-7014-5d19-b779-5f36c6bb4160"
            },
            {
              "content": "The user checked that a calendar-sharing screen showed only the time and hid the details.",
              "content_digest": "e182d94b728aa0057bf201f1caf924e715d12de484495d6bd653cd658c6fc091",
              "position": 6,
              "uid": "61ee4989-7372-5845-b14f-d8a6eb1e5300"
            },
            {
              "content": "When evening plans on the same day must change, the user's mother wants advance notice on the weekend morning.",
              "content_digest": "24ef090a587ad5f54aec84d231bed02577bfebc8ed2a487f0aea9eb3a6644f24",
              "position": 7,
              "uid": "f2b9f9b0-3d15-5411-9c40-ddce42288ed3"
            },
            {
              "content": "The local agent cannot know the private reason for unavailability from the unavailable time alone.",
              "content_digest": "a5ae072d060bfbae6e2d06ecaec6dad87039a14c3bee62dc0e3abd2a9096f5e2",
              "position": 8,
              "uid": "947e37c1-1235-54e1-8ddd-dcad7d725ede"
            },
            {
              "content": "The user's shared calendar does not automatically reserve travel time between events.",
              "content_digest": "44b0830b7ef31860d3bd70e859c449a2f8e5cecd94b4b571bf08e09da3f648eb",
              "position": 9,
              "uid": "1b2e9508-d9ce-5b27-bf66-ec7691061e13"
            }
          ],
          "side": "REFERENCE",
