          "memories": [
            {
              "content": "The user keeps the shared laundry-room access card in an entrance drawer.",
              "content_digest": "3c98e367c99e0867f1217c891dc5d982c115fd9d1b4bc3957cca6dbb6338203b",
              "position": 0,
              "uid": "a1c67646-6a75-504a-9508-d69e1d04b3e5"
            },
            {
              "content": "The user went downstairs 25 minutes after the laundry finished and received a note from another household.",
              "content_digest": "44968f6f10c0ae2d1dd775eb066564dada6346c6f59bdacf90d687c57e6c1e0f",
              "position": 1,
              "uid": "9479e799-95d7-50d2-af62-d1e0914a389b"
            },
            {
              "content": "For the next load, the user set a reminder five minutes before the end and removed the laundry immediately.",
              "content_digest": "bc77b81f6126e44bbffeb4ae2dfbb641d31a9742b7a196a106ac385321b48958",
              "position": 2,
              "uid": "528cb5ea-8c36-5206-beaa-19432250ec4d"
            },
            {
              "content": "The user washed light-colored clothes with new jeans, and color transferred onto white socks.",
              "content_digest": "ed0f36cf5ebe8f9542ad39ba45fc109634d72f1cb2b266c15dfe6655e3df3add",
              "position": 3,
              "uid": "85fb1639-2176-5329-b490-3325ff030db4"
            },
            {
              "content": "The user later washed the new jeans separately, and the color of the other clothes did not change.",
              "content_digest": "6e47fe1a02ac39064ea9db2d06d8a1f01f80302825bbe412df745401612e4a84",
              "position": 4,
              "uid": "431d170a-863f-596d-97c0-0c9634524ee5"
            },
            {
              "content": "On a day the user did not check the dryer filter, the clothes needed another drying cycle.",
              "content_digest": "8127e9f3ea34724673517f1e260a73acfb70e287a7e7de84e196ad1cb815f5a7",
              "position": 5,
              "uid": "4df33adc-cfba-50f2-b141-e2ebed38b81c"
            },
            {
              "content": "On the next use, after emptying the filter, the user finished drying in one cycle.",
              "content_digest": "932cfb8fc93277783d8990dad62cfd3e1c9a86e39ad1bd019ce00dac632c53d5",
              "position": 6,
              "uid": "ba7daae9-938d-55a1-af20-21cd10d395d8"
            },
            {
              "content": "The building manager judges that not leaving finished laundry for a long time is fair to other households.",
              "content_digest": "5eabe2d3dff252bb250abcde8fe2d528362afb0e73e7628e839715c3e8a3cd56",
              "position": 7,
              "uid": "abbf8742-38e3-5810-b222-fe91e3340962"
            },
            {
              "content": "When creating a shared laundry-room reminder, base it on the end time of the machine the user started.",
              "content_digest": "e00bc6fe09fea6fde6a27817bd6824a141c1ac4a656b9659067b7e1af9881b1f",
              "position": 8,
              "uid": "06273d22-0b42-5c55-9d70-eda14084219a"
            },
            {
              "content": "Even if the local agent knows where the card is kept, it cannot know which machines in the shared laundry room are currently available.",
              "content_digest": "d03f5583c9e4c686307af90ff00ff54e5ac0990e34296b3d241e4f299d15f4b7",
              "position": 9,
              "uid": "03ac930e-d745-5c29-8c24-5ced669817f9"
            }
          ],
